  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Just For The Halibut – Spacious Family Retreat with Private Pool! 🐟🏖️<br><br>**GOLF CART IS AVAILABLE FOR RENT FOR YOUR CONVENIENCE AT $100 PER DAY.**<br><br>Looking for a spacious home with a private pool and easy beach access? Look no further than Just For The Halibut! Completely updated from top to bottom, this beautiful home features custom hardwood floors, cozy coastal decor, and all the amenities to make it feel like your home away from home.<br><br>Living & Entertaining<br><br>Step into the open-concept living room with comfortable sofas (including a sleeper sofa) and a 65” flat-screen TV—perfect for watching the big game with the whole family. The kitchen overlooks the living space and is equipped with:<br><br>Stainless appliances and gas stove<br><br>Keurig coffee maker to start your day right<br><br>Gas grill just outside the sliding doors for easy outdoor cooking<br><br>The private backyard pool is perfect for family fun while you grill, relax, or enjoy the warm Florida sunshine.<br><br>Beach & Local Fun<br><br>A short walk to Gulf Place Beach Access puts you on sugar-white sands and sparkling waters in no time. Explore Gulf Place’s lively courtyard, family-friendly restaurants like Pizza By The Sea, The Perfect Pig, and Shunk Gulleys, and let the kids run wild in the open spaces.<br><br>Bedrooms & Comfort<br><br>1st Floor: King Bedroom<br><br>2nd Floor: Two King Bedrooms & Bunk Room with 2 Queen-over-Queen beds<br><br>All beds equipped with memory foam mattresses<br><br>Flat-screen TVs in every bedroom<br><br>Full bathrooms with hair dryers and ironing boards for your convenience<br><br>Perfect for family reunions, with three master bedrooms offering private retreats for adults and a bunk room ready for the kids.<br><br>Outdoor Fun & Extras<br><br>4 adult bikes for exploring the coast<br><br>Beach supplies and cooler included<br><br>Evening relaxation on the back patio with a dip in your private pool<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements (Sleeps 12)<br><br>1st Floor: King Bed<br><br>2nd Floor: 2 King Beds, Bunk Room (2 Queen-over-Queen beds)<br><br>Booking Policy<br><br>50% Deposit due at booking<br><br>Balance due 30 days prior to arrival<br><br>Check-In: 4:00 PM CST | Check-Out: 10:00 AM CST<br><br>Age Requirement: Must be 25+ to rent; 1 adult per 2 guests under 25<br><br>Pet-Friendly: One dog under 25 lbs allowed with $350 non-refundable fee<br><br>Ring Camera: Located at front door for security purposes<br><br>Cancellation: See contract for full policy<br><br>Just For The Halibut combines comfort, convenience, and coastal charm for the ultimate 30A family getaway. Book now and start making memories!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
